Tooltip searchcontainer/timecontainer_label
Filter by date range

Tooltip searchcontainer/searchclr
Clear your search

#-----------------------------------------------------------
# Search Filters
#-----------------------------------------------------------
Label searchcontainer/filter_label
Filters

Tooltip searchcontainer/starsearch
Show starred photos only 

Tooltip searchcontainer/moviesearch
Show movies only

Tooltip searchcontainer/webview
Show uploads to web albums only

Tooltip searchcontainer/facesearch
Show only photos with faces

Tooltip searchcontainer/geotagsearch
Show only photos with geotag